.el .ds Aq '
.TH dalgon-rpc 1  "dalgon-rpc " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-rpc \- Serve the JSON\-RPC protocol on standard input and output.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon rpc\fR [\fB\-\-socket\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve the JSON\-RPC protocol on standard input and output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR [\fI<FILE>\fR]
Listen on a local socket instead of standard input and output. FILE defaults to the per\-user socket.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
